OL,3,ALindsay Clancy's lawyer asks judge to
OL,4,Aremove juror from murder trial after
OL,5,Atense exchange
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe judge in Lindsay Clancy's murder
OL,8,Ftrial orders the jury to keep
OL,9,Fdeliberating on Friday after tense
OL,10,Fexchanges in court - what just
OL,11,Fhappened?
OL,13,FClancy is accused of murdering her
OL,14,Fthree small children in Massachusetts
OL,15,Fin 2023 - she does not dispute killing
OL,16,Fthem, but her lawyer argues she had
OL,17,Fpostpartum psychosis
OL,19,FIn a dramatic moment, Clancy's lawyer
OL,20,Fasks the judge to remove one juror who
OL,21,Fhe says isn't following the judge's
OL,22,Finstructions - watch the moment
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
